WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:05.850
When Hercul arrived at the smoking ruins of Elwin village, nothing remained upon the.

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:11.850
[Aleksandar] The royal insignia of Lighthaven's elite frontier high command.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:17.850
Hercul's jaw hardened with righteous fury.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:23.850
At their forefront loomed Grimli, a broad-shouldered dwarven blacksmith resting a colossal maul across.

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:29.850
[Grimli] A gilded hound from the royal holy guard sniffing around our docks!

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:35.850
The encounter flared instantly into violent misunderstanding.

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:41.850
[Aila] You will tear not one orphan from this harbor, court lapdog! Drop your steel!

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:47.850
A silver-tipped quarrel whistled straight for Hercul's eyes.

00:00:48.150 --> 00:00:53.850
[Hercul] Hold your hands, Grimli! His tread bears no bloodlust toward the innocent!

00:00:54.150 --> 00:00:59.850
Yet the roar of battle drowned his counsel.

00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:05.850
The skirmish was halted by a ragged young girl who darted out from behind.

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:11.850
[Hercul] Sir Knight, please cease.

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:17.850
Hercul's warhammer froze mid-swing.

00:01:18.150 --> 00:01:23.850
[Grimli] Curse my squinting eyes.

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:29.850
Raising Aleksandar's broken sword, Hercul recounted the tragic stand at Elwin village, the valor.

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:35.850
[Aleksandar] Aleksandar's wife escaped into the savage frost of the northern Wildlands.

00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:41.850
[Gawain] We are men and women who dwell within the border shadows.

00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:47.850
[Aleksandar] Consider it done.

00:01:48.150 --> 00:01:53.850
[Kaze] And I shall grant him the sharpest instincts and dagger arts to outwit any...

00:01:54.150 --> 00:01:59.850
[Rondol] And the endurance to navigate tempestuous tides upon unyielding waters.

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:05.850
[Eliana] And the wisdom of nature to identify deadly venoms and mend shattered bones.

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:11.850
[Robinyard] With my acrobatic balance to dance across chasms without fear, the boy will be peerless.

00:02:12.150 --> 00:02:17.850
[Balian] Then I shall plunge into the gilded darkness of the Red Glass Court to...

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:23.850
[Gawain] Then let us seal one more compact, Paladin.

00:02:24.150 --> 00:02:29.850
[Hercul] So be it.

00:02:30.150 --> 00:02:35.850
Thus was born the legend of the Oath of the Seven Pursuers.
